+ * we download tsp_novatek/nt36525_a32_sharp.bin (a32x_nvt_fw.h, generated by
+ * port/tools/nvtfw2h.py) into its SRAM at every boot, hardware-CRC flow of the
+ * NT36672A memory map (SWRST_N8 0x3F0FE, SPI_RD_FAST 0x3F310 from the A32 DT).
+ * Protocol: write = {addr|0x80 ...}, set page = {0xFF, addr>>15, addr>>7},
+ * read = {addr & 0x7F, dummy, data...}. Events at 0x21C00, 6 bytes per finger.
