+ * 20/21/22/23 mode 1, reset GPIO 7. Clock gate ifrao_spi1 = infracfg_ao
+ * +0xA8 (CLR) bit 6. Coordinates (720x1600) are mapped through the fb fit
+ * (0208) into the space SweetHIDTouch expects (0058/0061).
